{"seq":3,"slug":"text-synchronization","title":"文本同步","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/lsp-specification/text-synchronization","wordCount":1218,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"文本同步\">文本同步</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>文本同步要解决的问题是：<strong>让服务端的内存文档模型始终与编辑器中的真实文本保持一致</strong>。服务端不能直接读磁盘（用户可能还没保存），只能靠客户端在每次编辑时主动告知变更。这带来三个相互牵连的机制：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>解决的问题</th>\n<th>关键手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>生命周期事件</td>\n<td>文档何时建立、更新、释放</td>\n<td>didOpen/didChange/didSave/didClose</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同步策略</td>\n<td>每次变更发送多少内容</td>\n<td>全量（整篇）/ 增量（range+text）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本号</td>\n<td>乱序或丢失的变更如何识别</td>\n<td>单调递增的 <code>version</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选用增量同步时，还有一个隐藏前提：客户端和服务端对「第几个字符」的算法必须一致，这正是位置编码协商要保证的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"文档生命周期事件\">文档生命周期事件</h2><p>LSP 中的文本同步是编辑器与语言服务器之间最频繁的交互。每当用户打开、编辑或关闭文件时，编辑器通过通知消息将文档状态同步给服务端。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface DidOpenTextDocumentParams {&#10;  textDocument: TextDocumentItem;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface TextDocumentItem {&#10;  uri: string;&#10;  languageId: string;&#10;  version: number;&#10;  text: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface DidCloseTextDocumentParams {&#10;  textDocument: TextDocumentIdentifier;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DidOpenTextDocumentParams</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  textDocument</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TextDocumentItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TextDocumentItem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  uri</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  languageId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DidCloseTextDocumentParams</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  textDocument</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TextDocumentIdentifier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant E as 编辑器&#10;    participant S as 语言服务器&#10;&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;S: textDocument/didOpen (完整文本)&#10;    Note right of S: 建立文档模型&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;S: textDocument/didChange (变更事件)&#10;    Note right of S: 更新文档模型&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;S: textDocument/didChange (变更事件)&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;S: textDocument/didSave (保存通知)&#10;    Note right of S: 触发完整分析&#10;    E-&gt;&gt;S: textDocument/didClose&#10;    Note right of S: 释放文档资源\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant E as 编辑器\n    participant S as 语言服务器\n\n    E-&gt;&gt;S: textDocument/didOpen (完整文本)\n    Note right of S: 建立文档模型\n    E-&gt;&gt;S: textDocument/didChange (变更事件)\n    Note right of S: 更新文档模型\n    E-&gt;&gt;S: textDocument/didChange (变更事件)\n    E-&gt;&gt;S: textDocument/didSave (保存通知)\n    Note right of S: 触发完整分析\n    E-&gt;&gt;S: textDocument/didClose\n    Note right of S: 释放文档资源</pre><p>文档生命周期事件一览：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>事件</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>携带内容</th>\n<th>触发时机</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>didOpen</td>\n<td>客户端→服务端</td>\n<td>完整文本 + 版本号</td>\n<td>用户打开文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>didChange</td>\n<td>客户端→服务端</td>\n<td>变更内容 + 新版本</td>\n<td>用户编辑文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>didSave</td>\n<td>客户端→服务端</td>\n<td>可选完整文本</td>\n<td>用户保存文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>didClose</td>\n<td>客户端→服务端</td>\n<td>文档标识符</td>\n<td>用户关闭文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>willSave</td>\n<td>客户端→服务端</td>\n<td>保存原因</td>\n<td>保存前通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>willSaveWaitUntil</td>\n<td>客户端→服务端</td>\n<td>保存原因</td>\n<td>保存前等待编辑</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>didOpen</code> 发送完整文本内容，此后 <code>didChange</code> 只发送变更部分（增量模式）或完整文本（全量模式），取决于同步策略。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"全量同步-vs-增量同步\">全量同步 vs 增量同步</h2><p>LSP 定义了两种文本同步策略，通过 <code>textDocumentSync</code> 能力声明。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"enum TextDocumentSyncKind {&#10;  None = 0,&#10;  Full = 1,&#10;  Incremental = 2,&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface TextDocumentSyncOptions {&#10;  openClose?: boolean;&#10;  change?: TextDocumentSyncKind;&#10;  willSave?: boolean;&#10;  willSaveWaitUntil?: boolean;&#10;  save?: boolean | SaveOptions;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">enum</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TextDocumentSyncKind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  None</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  Full</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  Incremental</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TextDocumentSyncOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  openClose</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  change</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TextDocumentSyncKind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  willSave</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  willSaveWaitUntil</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  save</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SaveOptions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"全量同步\">全量同步</h3><p>每次变更发送整个文档内容，实现简单但带宽消耗大。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface FullDocumentChangeEvent {&#10;  text: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;connection.onDidChangeTextDocument((params) =&gt; {&#10;  const fullText = params.contentChanges[0].text;&#10;  documents.set(params.textDocument.uri, fullText);&#10;  validateDocument(params.textDocument.uri);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FullDocumentChangeEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">connection.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onDidChangeTextDocument</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fullText</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> params.contentChanges[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].text;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  documents.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(params.textDocument.uri, fullText);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  validateDocument</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(params.textDocument.uri);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"增量同步\">增量同步</h3><p>只发送变更的范围和新文本，带宽高效但实现复杂。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface IncrementalChangeEvent {&#10;  range: Range;&#10;  rangeLength?: number;&#10;  text: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Range {&#10;  start: Position;&#10;  end: Position;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface Position {&#10;  line: number;&#10;  character: number;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> IncrementalChangeEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  range</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  rangeLength</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  end</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  line</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  character</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两种模式对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>全量同步 (Full)</th>\n<th>增量同步 (Incremental)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>带宽消耗</td>\n<td>高（整个文档）</td>\n<td>低（仅变更部分）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现难度</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n<td>复杂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态一致性</td>\n<td>始终一致</td>\n<td>需正确应用变更序列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大文件性能</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>容错性</td>\n<td>天然容错</td>\n<td>一个变更丢失全部失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>原型开发、小文件</td>\n<td>生产环境、大文件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 全量同步&#10;        CHANGE1[用户输入 &#39;a&#39;] --&gt; FULL1[&quot;发送: 完整文档 (10KB)&quot;]&#10;        CHANGE2[用户输入 &#39;b&#39;] --&gt; FULL2[&quot;发送: 完整文档 (10KB)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 增量同步&#10;        CHANGE3[用户输入 &#39;a&#39;] --&gt; INCR1[&quot;发送: {range, text: &#39;a&#39;} (50B)&quot;]&#10;        CHANGE4[用户输入 &#39;b&#39;] --&gt; INCR2[&quot;发送: {range, text: &#39;b&#39;} (50B)&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 全量同步\n        CHANGE1[用户输入 'a'] --&gt; FULL1[\"发送: 完整文档 (10KB)\"]\n        CHANGE2[用户输入 'b'] --&gt; FULL2[\"发送: 完整文档 (10KB)\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 增量同步\n        CHANGE3[用户输入 'a'] --&gt; INCR1[\"发送: {range, text: 'a'} (50B)\"]\n        CHANGE4[用户输入 'b'] --&gt; INCR2[\"发送: {range, text: 'b'} (50B)\"]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"版本号与一致性\">版本号与一致性</h2><p>每个文档携带单调递增的版本号 <code>version</code>，用于保证客户端与服务端的状态一致性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface VersionedTextDocumentIdentifier {&#10;  uri: string;&#10;  version: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function applyChanges(document: TextDocument, params: DidChangeTextDocumentParams): void {&#10;  if (params.textDocument.version &lt;= document.version) {&#10;    return;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  for (const change of params.contentChanges) {&#10;    if (&#39;range&#39; in change) {&#10;      applyIncrementalChange(document, change);&#10;    } else {&#10;      document.content = change.text;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  document.version = params.textDocument.version;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> VersionedTextDocumentIdentifier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  uri</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> applyChanges</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">document</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TextDocument</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DidChangeTextDocumentParams</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shi